  "body": "The algorithms for the methods on CookieStoreManager in https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#CookieStoreManager all use `Let registration be this.`, and then operate on `registration`as if it is a `service worker registration`. But `this` in this context would be the actual `CookieStoreManager` object.\r\n\r\nThe `CookieStoreManager` object probably needs to have an associated service worker registration, which the algorithms can then use instead.",
